L713: 6
L714: recommended) 13b For each group, losses and exclusions after randomisation, together with reasons 6
L715: Recruitment 14a Dates defining the periods of recruitment and follow-up 14b Why the trial ended or was stopped           Baseline data 15 A table showing baseline demographic and clinical characteristics for each group 7
L716: Numbers analysed 16 For each group, number of participants (denominator) included in each analysis and whether the analysis was 6
L717: by original assigned groups
